        <li><a href="/LearningAdmin/Index">Learning Material Maker</a> — Create and edit learning guides (title, content, image modules)</li>
        <li><a href="/QuizAdmin/Index">Quiz Admin</a> — Manage quiz questions</li>
        <li><a href="/FeedbackAdmin/Index">Feedback Admin</a> — View feedback reports</li>
    </ul>
</div>
